# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages automatically serves Avinash.html at the clean
# URL /Avinash (it auto-redirects any *.html file to its extension-less
# path). Adding an explicit "/Avinash /Avinash.html 200" rule here clashes
# with that automatic behaviour and causes an infinite redirect loop
# (ERR_TOO_MANY_REDIRECTS) in production on Cloudflare Pages. Do NOT add
# that rule back. We only need a one-hop redirect for the lowercase path.
/avinash /Avinash.html 301
